<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index rose 5.12 to 645.32, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.12.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 330 to 237.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 28,533,375 compared with 30,095,910 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1830))</p>
